<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank satisfied with current exchange rate.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank satisfied with current exchange rate.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech central bank (CNB) on Monday said it was satisfied with the current exchange rate of the crown of 2.8 percent below the midpoint of its dollar/mark basket.</p>
</text>
